  "synopsis": "Shuwawan! chronicles the family life of real-life photographer and essayist Harumichi Saitou. Saitou and his wife are both deaf, his children are both hearing, and the family communicates in sign language. The anime draws on Saitou's own Ikuji Manga Nikki (Child-rearing Manga Diary) work.\n\n(Source: ANN)",
  "synopsis_es": "¡Shuwawan! narra la vida familiar del fotógrafo y ensayista de la vida real Harumichi Saitou. Saitou y su esposa son sordos, sus hijos oyen y la familia se comunica mediante lenguaje de señas. El anime se basa en el trabajo Ikuji Manga Nikki (Diario de manga de crianza infantil) del propio Saitou.\n\n(Fuente: ANN)",
